# Form Components

## Input Components

### Basic Input Field
```typescript
import { Input } from "@/components/ui/input"
import { Label } from "@/components/ui/label"

<div className="space-y-2">
  <Label htmlFor="email" className="text-sm font-medium text-content-dark">
    Email
  </Label>
  <Input
    id="email"
    type="email"
    className="border-border-DEFAULT focus:border-primary"
    placeholder="Enter your email"
  />
</div>
```

### Select Field
```typescript
import {
  Select,
  SelectContent,
  SelectItem,
  SelectTrigger,
  SelectValue,
} from "@/components/ui/select"

<Select>
  <SelectTrigger className="border-border-DEFAULT">
    <SelectValue placeholder="Select option" />
  </SelectTrigger>
  <SelectContent>
    <SelectItem value="option1">Option 1</SelectItem>
    <SelectItem value="option2">Option 2</SelectItem>
  </SelectContent>
</Select>
```

### Form Field Variants

#### Text Input with Validation
```typescript
<div className="space-y-2">
  <Label htmlFor="username" className="text-sm font-medium">
    Username
  </Label>
  <Input
    id="username"
    className={cn(
      "border-border-DEFAULT",
      error && "border-red-500 focus:border-red-500"
    )}
    {...register("username")}
  />
  {error && (
    <p className="text-sm text-red-500">{error.message}</p>
  )}
</div>
```

#### Textarea Field
```typescript
<div className="space-y-2">
  <Label htmlFor="description">Description</Label>
  <Textarea
    id="description"
    className="min-h-[100px]"
    placeholder="Enter description"
  />
</div>
```

#### Checkbox Field
```typescript
<div className="flex items-center space-x-2">
  <Checkbox id="terms" />
  <Label htmlFor="terms" className="text-sm">
    I agree to the terms and conditions
  </Label>
</div>
```

### Form Layout Components

#### Form Section
```typescript
interface FormSectionProps {
  title: string
  description?: string
  children: React.ReactNode
}

const FormSection = ({ title, description, children }: FormSectionProps) => (
  <div className="space-y-4">
    <div>
      <h3 className="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900">{title}</h3>
      {description && (
        <p className="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">{description}</p>
      )}
    </div>
    <div className="space-y-4">
      {children}
    </div>
  </div>
)
```

#### Form Grid
```typescript
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
  <FormField name="firstName" label="First Name" />
  <FormField name="lastName" label="Last Name" />
</div>
```

### Usage Guidelines
1. Group related fields logically
2. Provide clear labels and placeholders
3. Show validation feedback immediately
4. Use appropriate input types
5. Include helper text when needed
6. Implement proper error states
7. Consider form accessibility

### Accessibility Considerations
- Use proper label associations
- Provide error feedback to screen readers
- Maintain keyboard navigation
- Use proper ARIA attributes
- Ensure sufficient color contrast
- Support form validation

### Best Practices
1. Validate input in real-time
2. Show clear error messages
3. Use consistent styling
4. Handle loading states
5. Implement proper form submission
6. Consider mobile input methods
7. Maintain proper spacing

### Styling Guidelines
1. Use consistent spacing
2. Apply proper typography
3. Style validation states
4. Handle focus states
5. Implement proper borders
6. Consider field sizes
